        <obo:IAO_0000115>Compartment of trunk, which is embryologically derived from the intraembryonic celom; is located in the trunk, is enclosed by  the body wall; contains serous sacs, viscera and other organs. Examples: There is only one body cavity.</obo:IAO_0000115>
